XDG Desktop Portal Integration for Marshal
=============================================

Setup:
1. Install xdg-desktop-portal and xdg-desktop-portal-wlr:
   sudo pacman -S xdg-desktop-portal xdg-desktop-portal-wlr

2. Install portal config:
   sudo cp marshal.portal /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/
   sudo cp marshal-portals.conf /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/

3. Add screencopy protocol to compositor (see below).

4. Start portal services before the compositor:
   systemctl --user enable xdg-desktop-portal.service
   systemctl --user enable xdg-desktop-portal-wlr.service

Alternatively, start from the session boot script (session-start.sh).

Screencopy Protocol:
The compositor must implement zwlr-screencopy-unstable-v1 for screen
sharing to work. The protocol XML is in compositor/protocols/ and the
implementation belongs in compositor/compositor.c.

Environment variables (set by session-start.sh):
  XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=marshal
  XDG_SESSION_TYPE=wayland
